{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/504812-how-could-a-demon-be-a-demiurge","id":504812,"title":"How could a Demon be a demiurge","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-05T17:17:58-07:00","id":504812,"title":"How could a Demon be a demiurge","content":"I've been reading Saturnine nights and it explains how you need to abandon the supernatural to draw on the Divine Flame, to create a promethean. It seems unlikely that one of the unchained could do that.....but the book proves that the impossible isn't always impossible.<br /> <br /> What would it take?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5544-ancientswordrage","name":"AncientSwordRage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-05T17:47:29-07:00","id":504867,"title":"","content":"Demon feels terrible guilt for consuming someone's soul to create a new cover, and sets out obsessively seeking a way to &quot;separate&quot; itself from that cover and return the original to life. It takes years of research, theft and learning to uncover the tools an exploits he believes necessary for the job (possibly his cipher): Suborned Infrastructure, several exploits and a human body turned gadget. The process even appears successful, the cover cut free and 'reintegrated' with the human form, but the result is...incomplete. A Promethean.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></u>*</b><br /> <i>*All other colors should be read aloud in the voice of Don Knotts</i><b>.</b> <hr /><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/18519-pendragon-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">Hacks and House Rules Hub Thread</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>CofD Hacks By Splat: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13vBLaS5Ua1Ez-cVyK6uFa4ssvYeIIZpoA5GQTXytfcA/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Vampire</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqltG7X-C_MdEe00PtVOZmki8V_K1M1FpQtLwTvb2jg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#006400\">Werewolf</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bpr1EjQ4RfZ5dz-tXmJJ93P2f_l7fUIUwpPLWs9Z-SI/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">Mage</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vKpSTktCUuUaqxXncG4txQPtvPclzXlFZEEX7tbrTSg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Mummy</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Spynbcs_VgCDHdooKWXobZNe6C9CMjONeRTlvXIq9fI/edit?usp=drive_web\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Demon</span></a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/148-pendragon","name":"PenDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1657"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-05T18:04:09-07:00","id":504875,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PenDragon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/504812-how-could-a-demon-be-a-demiurge?p=504867#post504867\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Demon feels terrible guilt for consuming someone's soul to create a new cover, and sets out obsessively seeking a way to &quot;separate&quot; itself from that cover and return the original to life. It takes years of research, theft and learning to uncover the tools an exploits he believes necessary for the job (possibly his cipher): Suborned Infrastructure, several exploits and a human body turned gadget. The process even appears successful, the cover cut free and 'reintegrated' with the human form, but the result is...incomplete. A Promethean.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> But how does the Demon get the Pyros? Through an exploit? Through the infrastructure.?<br /> <br /> Of the two the infrastructure feels most right, but is too repeatable...and not 'human' enough. I know demon's re-write reality daily, but the Pyros and the Divine flame feel like they should be excluded.<br /> <br /> I like you answer though!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5544-ancientswordrage","name":"AncientSwordRage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-05T18:13:53-07:00","id":504904,"title":"","content":"Pyros? Maybe some humanity remains within the demon's cover? Maybe he harvests some from a quashmal (skinning angels to make a man)? Perhaps it's a function of the Infrastructure, custom Exploit, maybe Aether and Pyros are closer together than people tend to think. Or perhaps one needn't be human to be human, if you catch my drift.<br /> <br /> It doesn't really matter, this is well within the zone of Golden Rule, storyteller fiat effects.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <b>Mod Voice is <u><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">RED</span></u>*</b><br /> <i>*All other colors should be read aloud in the voice of Don Knotts</i><b>.</b> <hr /><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/18519-pendragon-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">Hacks and House Rules Hub Thread</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>CofD Hacks By Splat: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13vBLaS5Ua1Ez-cVyK6uFa4ssvYeIIZpoA5GQTXytfcA/edit\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Vampire</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1sqltG7X-C_MdEe00PtVOZmki8V_K1M1FpQtLwTvb2jg/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#006400\">Werewolf</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1bpr1EjQ4RfZ5dz-tXmJJ93P2f_l7fUIUwpPLWs9Z-SI/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">Mage</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1vKpSTktCUuUaqxXncG4txQPtvPclzXlFZEEX7tbrTSg/edit#\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Mummy</span></a> | <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Spynbcs_VgCDHdooKWXobZNe6C9CMjONeRTlvXIq9fI/edit?usp=drive_web\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Demon</span></a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/148-pendragon","name":"PenDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar148_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1657"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-05T21:07:43-07:00","id":504992,"title":"","content":"Well remember by &quot;abandoning the supernatural&quot; it mostly means not trying to cheat with your supernatural powers- so no embeds, exploits, or gadgets.<br /> <br /> Depending on what the demon is actually trying to accomplish here, it's not hard to imagine that there might be no embeds, exploits, or gadgets to cheat with.<br /> <br /> As for how the demon connects with pyros? Volcanic eruptions and tsunamis can create extempores, humanity isn't a requirement for creating a promethean.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-06T12:36:45-07:00","id":505970,"title":"","content":"Forcing themselves into a position to be desperate enough to let lighting strike.<br /> <br /> It's hard as any supernatural, harder still for a demon-you know the expanses of your own greatness better than most, so how can you ever become so mono-focused on creating life like this, to feel that human level of desperation?<br /> <br /> Hard, but not impossible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-06T13:49:20-07:00","id":506032,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/504812-how-could-a-demon-be-a-demiurge?p=505970#post505970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Forcing themselves into a position to be desperate enough to let lighting strike.<br /> <br /> It's hard as any supernatural, harder still for a demon-you know the expanses of your own greatness better than most, so how can you ever become so mono-focused on creating life like this, to feel that human level of desperation?<br /> <br /> Hard, but not impossible.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The only way I can think of a Demon becoming so obsessed with something is that they think it's part of their journey to Hell. Perhaps it involves an interlock (but that would violate the no-supernatural rule).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5544-ancientswordrage","name":"AncientSwordRage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-06T13:52:24-07:00","id":506034,"title":"","content":"Yeah, probably.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-06T15:50:45-07:00","id":506148,"title":"","content":"I'm thinking that maybe the Interlocks of an eventual Demonic Demiurge would have more to do with Demon-Promethean interaction (which would get the Demon more familiar with how Prometheans are made and the nature of the Divine Fire) and procuring/creating the body that would become the Promethean. I like the concept of a Demon tearing out one of its Covers to create a new creature, and perhaps its Bestowment might be the ability to partially ape cover maybe with a temporary mini-Pact capability? I could definitely see a lot of interesting Milestones coming out of wearing a person's face (or job, or girlfriend) for a week.<br /> <br /> ...Excuse me, I have to go write some stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-06T16:42:14-07:00","id":506222,"title":"","content":"I'd be happy to see it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-06T17:30:28-07:00","id":506260,"title":"","content":"I actually have a plan for my demon to try and build a demon from scratch and accidentally create a prometheum instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T07:56:32-07:00","id":508972,"title":"","content":"Okay, I did that writing I said I was going to do: Prometheans made by Demon, Changeling and Sin-Eater. The Demon one, which is pertinent to this thread, takes up the first 3 pages.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/116LMdtMWBsdZwyaCHquaPa0_qVjmVtQFBMDEGgyo9NQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Link is here.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T12:39:20-07:00","id":509190,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/504812-how-could-a-demon-be-a-demiurge?p=508972#post508972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, I did that writing I said I was going to do: Prometheans made by Demon, Changeling and Sin-Eater. The Demon one, which is pertinent to this thread, takes up the first 3 pages.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;&#91;url\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/116LMdtMWBsdZwyaCHquaPa0_qVjmVtQFBMDEGgyo9NQ/edit?usp=sharing&amp;quot;]Link</a> is here.[/URL]</div> </div> </div> </div> Nice! All of them have some pretty cool ideas behind them, though I'm not well versed enough in mechanics to judge those(save that maybe allowing a Lineage to learn powers from an entirely different group is perhaps too powerful). <br /> <br /> As for the Agent, he seems good, though his Wasteland is a bit divergent from how these things seem to work. Maybe make it so the area comes &quot;closer&quot; to the Machine? That is, people become paranoid, feeling like they're being watched even as they spy on everyone else, while those in the area find themselves subject to bizarre compulsions that build half-hearted occult matrices, rendering the area increasingly stranger even as it makes Angel summoning much easier, though they often come with garbled, confused orders that make them statistically more likely to fall.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-09T13:26:32-07:00","id":509215,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ZealousChristian24</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/504812-how-could-a-demon-be-a-demiurge?p=509190#post509190\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Nice! All of them have some pretty cool ideas behind them, though I'm not well versed enough in mechanics to judge those(save that maybe allowing a Lineage to learn powers from an entirely different group is perhaps too powerful).</div> </div> </div> </div>If you're referring to the Changeling-based one, I didn't think it would be too unbalanced, seeing as Contract Clauses are at about the same power level as Transmutations when taken separately, but really, I just wanted it to be really unique and strongly Fairy-themed. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> As for the Agent, he seems good, though his Wasteland is a bit divergent from how these things seem to work. Maybe make it so the area comes &quot;closer&quot; to the Machine? That is, people become paranoid, feeling like they're being watched even as they spy on everyone else, while those in the area find themselves subject to bizarre compulsions that build half-hearted occult matrices, rendering the area increasingly stranger even as it makes Angel summoning much easier, though they often come with garbled, confused orders that make them statistically more likely to fall. </div> </div> </div>I like that idea on the Wasteland. I'm definitely gonna incorporate it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-10T01:05:13-07:00","id":509725,"title":"","content":"I love the right ups! Food for thought. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/504812-how-could-a-demon-be-a-demiurge?p=509215#post509215\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you're referring to the Changeling-based one, I didn't think it would be too unbalanced, seeing as Contract Clauses are at about the same power level as Transmutations when taken separately, but really, I just wanted it to be really unique and strongly Fairy-themed.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree it looks powerful to give other supernaturals each others powers, but what you said is right. By the looks of it that's just a differently worded set of transmutations<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/504812-how-could-a-demon-be-a-demiurge?p=509215#post509215\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like that idea on the Wasteland. I'm definitely gonna incorporate it.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree, that's a much better wasteland affect as it adds that complication you need, and feels more thematic.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5544-ancientswordrage","name":"AncientSwordRage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-10T20:48:49-07:00","id":510423,"title":"","content":"I looked at the lineages yesterday, doesn't the changeling lineage gain access to fetch echoes, not contracts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-11T04:16:19-07:00","id":510532,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/504812-how-could-a-demon-be-a-demiurge?p=510423#post510423\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I looked at the lineages yesterday, doesn't the changeling lineage gain access to fetch echoes, not contracts?</div> </div> </div> </div>They get the Enter the Hedge Echo plus one other Echo as their Bestowment, but they can take Contract clauses as non-affinity Transmutations.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-11T19:12:10-07:00","id":511415,"title":"","content":"Ah okay, my eyes must have glossed over that part.<br /> <br /> But thematically, isn't that a little weird? Fetches don't get contracts, changelings don't get echoes, kind of makes that lineage all over the place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":391,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","user":"StSword","date":". 05-11-2015, 10:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-12T05:55:03-07:00","id":511935,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/504812-how-could-a-demon-be-a-demiurge?p=511415#post511415\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ah okay, my eyes must have glossed over that part.<br /> <br /> But thematically, isn't that a little weird? Fetches don't get contracts, changelings don't get echoes, kind of makes that lineage all over the place.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, she's not really a fetch. The idea was that she had some traits from the Fetch she was made from, the Changeling that made her, and her natural Promethean state. She is, like any other Created made by a Supernatural, an impossibility.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T16:33:33-07:00","id":561321,"title":"","content":"So, I added a Beast-Made Promethean. She isn't friendly.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/116LMdtMWBsdZwyaCHquaPa0_qVjmVtQFBMDEGgyo9NQ/edit#bookmark=id.y0qt2a68b2k9\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/116LMdtMWBsdZwyaCHquaPa0_qVjmVtQFBMDEGgyo9NQ/edit#bookmark=id.y0qt2a68b2k9\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/116LMdtMWBsdZwyaCHquaPa0_qVjmVtQFBMDEGgyo9NQ/edit#bookmark=id.y0qt2a68b2k9\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/116LMdtMWBsdZwyaCHquaPa0_qVjmVtQFBMDEGgyo9NQ/edit#bookmark=id.y0qt2a68b2k9 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T19:08:08-07:00","id":561484,"title":"","content":"Remember that the key is obsession. So, its quite common for some Unchained to be experimenting on people in order to make them more demon-like. A demon who's experimenting on ways to make the perfect human-demon hybrid starts going further and further afield from the basic occult physics of the God Machine, until....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T23:11:43-07:00","id":561617,"title":"","content":"About the night huntress write up, her actions and motivations are far more in tune with stannum than centimanus.<br /> <br /> I believe in the story hook in which it says &quot;she failed to create prometheans&quot; I presume you meant that she's leaving pandorans in her wake, and if she's a centimanus then those are pandorans are valid offspring, since controlling pandorans is a thing for centimani after all. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-20T09:23:58-07:00","id":562003,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/504812-how-could-a-demon-be-a-demiurge?p=561617#post561617\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> About the night huntress write up, her actions and motivations are far more in tune with stannum than centimanus.<br /> <br /> I believe in the story hook in which it says &quot;she failed to create prometheans&quot; I presume you meant that she's leaving pandorans in her wake, and if she's a centimanus then those are pandorans are valid offspring, since controlling pandorans is a thing for centimani after all.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair enough. I was kind of waffling between them for a while.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-20T18:33:43-07:00","id":562449,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/504812-how-could-a-demon-be-a-demiurge?p=561321#post561321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I added a Beast-Made Promethean. She isn't friendly.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/116LMdtMWBsdZwyaCHquaPa0_qVjmVtQFBMDEGgyo9NQ/edit#bookmark=id.y0qt2a68b2k9\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...d.y0qt2a68b2k9</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Interesting, would you mind if I put a link in this thread?:<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/403822-share-your-custom-lineages\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...ustom-lineages</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/12.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div> &quot;A free society is one in which it is safe to be unpopular.&quot;<br /> <span style=\"color:DarkRed\"><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><span style=\"font-family:Comic Sans MS\">I find <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=3&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwin4NXQzLfXAhVGySYKHV3TDXYQFgg3MAI&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.ign.com%2Farticles%2F2017%2F04%2F25%2Fmarvels-nick-spencer-on-captain-americas-betrayal-and-handling-fan-reactions&amp;usg=AOvVaw2EcsX7n5ebntygb0TizyGl\" target=\"_blank\">Nick Spencer</a> and <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=t&amp;rct=j&amp;q=&amp;esrc=s&amp;source=web&amp;cd=4&amp;cad=rja&amp;uact=8&amp;ved=0ahUKEwiK7d7szLfXAhXCWSYKHTpKBbcQFgg4MAM&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FRichard_B._Spencer&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tuP6phfINia-bh_jWsDT_\" target=\"_blank\">Richard Spencer</a> to be equally repulsive.</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6138-mangle77","name":"Mangle77","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg