om/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6138_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-22T06:43:52-07:00","id":564066,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/504812-how-could-a-demon-be-a-demiurge?p=508972#post508972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, I did that writing I said I was going to do: Prometheans made by Demon, Changeling and Sin-Eater. The Demon one, which is pertinent to this thread, takes up the first 3 pages.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/116LMdtMWBsdZwyaCHquaPa0_qVjmVtQFBMDEGgyo9NQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Link is here.</a></div> </div> </div> </div>I liked all of them (including the Beast one). I'd probably tone down the mechanical side of a couple if I used them (restrict Agent Eight's pacts to physical characteristics, and not give Carla access to Contracts), but that's a minor quibble. Regardless, they sure put the lie to the idea that supernaturals shouldn't be demiurges because themes.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}